    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 A mechanical golem owned by the Lord of Innadril Castle. The lord's family has been protected by Eva for generations. This golem was created to protect the Garden of Eva, made by a dwarven master artisan. It is a guard to fend off the Water Dragon Fafurion's troops, or invaders threatening the garden. The dwarven master made two other golems, but this third version was the strongest and became the last one remaining. Magic Creatures Lv. 2 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Magic Creatures. P. Def. +5% Max HP +3% Received Critical Damage -10% Received M. Crit. Damage -10% Resistance to Bleed +20% Resistance to Bow +10% Resistance to Crossbow +10% Speed -5 Resistance to Blunt -10% Resistance to Dual Blunt -10% Light Armor Type Lv. 3 Weak P. Def. and strong Evasion. Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
